%% TRIP-033 Agneta polish
%% How an answer reaches the visitor whole.
flowchart TD
    A[Visitor opens the chat] --> B[Header: name, Kundtjänstmedarbetare, green dot Live - R1]
    B --> C[Greeting Vad vill du?! saved, never sent - R2]
    C --> D[Question to /api/chat]
    D --> E[Model answers with the tone from the first answer - R3]
    E --> F{stop_reason is max_tokens?}
    F -- no --> H[Answer as it is]
    F -- yes --> G[Log it, cut at the last whole bullet or word - R4]
    G --> H
    H --> I[Reader: bullet with link, one sub-bullet; half link removed - R4 R5 R7]
    I --> J[Bubble in the wider panel - R6]
